{"logId": "2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [847, 134, 1082, 249], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[847.0, 134.0], [1082.0, 134.0], [1082.0, 249.0], [847.0, 249.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "足，有些是令顾客十分气愤的。比如个别员工对顾客态度粗暴了，在工作中不是按照理念最大限度满足顾客的要求和利益等。一旦出现上述情况，我们都要毫不留情地马上处理。但另一方面，我们对员工是负责任的，我们力争为每一名员工提供最好的工资待遇，提供最完善的社会保障，提供最大的发展空间，真正让人尽其才，劳有所得，快乐生活，贡献社会。", "block_bbox": [198, 228, 976, 395], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 228.0], [976.0, 228.0], [976.0, 395.0], [198.0, 395.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "史延伟说，我们有信心让胖东来的员工从心底里感受到，胖东来的员工是生活在一个幸福、和谐的大家庭，我们也有信心服务好新乡人民，成为新乡人民生活中不可或缺的好朋友！", "block_bbox": [199, 403, 976, 499], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 403.0], [976.0, 403.0], [976.0, 499.0], [199.0, 499.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "古人云：“天行健，君子当自强不息。” 记者想把这句话送给在新乡刮起商业“旋风”的胖东来百货，也送给一切有志于繁荣新乡经济的弄潮儿……", "block_bbox": [198, 508, 976, 568], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 508.0], [976.0, 508.0], [976.0, 568.0], [198.0, 568.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "专家解析胖东来现象", "block_bbox": [239, 613, 436, 639], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 613.0], [436.0, 613.0], [436.0, 639.0], [239.0, 639.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "河南师范大学经济与管理学院党委书记、公共关系学副教授朱建认为，胖东来商贸集", "block_bbox": [238, 648, 974, 675], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 648.0], [974.0, 648.0], [974.0, 675.0], [238.0, 675.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "团选择到我市投资建商场，说明了我市经济发展较为繁荣的现状。有人放言，我市平原路上的商场已近饱和，其实不然，在他看来，我市的市场繁荣程度还不够，缺乏成规模的、品质优异的大型综合商场，市民的购买欲望还没有被完全激发出来。而胖东来百货的进驻，无疑成为我市市场繁荣的一个新的经济增长点。", "block_bbox": [199, 683, 529, 987], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 683.0], [529.0, 683.0], [529.0, 987.0], [199.0, 987.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "胖东来百货为什么人气如此旺", "block_bbox": [240, 996, 527, 1021], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 996.0], [527.0, 996.0], [527.0, 1021.0], [240.0, 1021.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [553, 705, 964, 987], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[553.0, 705.0], [964.0, 705.0], [964.0, 987.0], [553.0, 987.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "篮球比赛现场", "block_bbox": [842, 995, 950, 1015], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[842.0, 995.0], [949.0, 995.0], [949.0, 1014.0], [842.0, 1014.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "盛？朱建坦率地讲，胖东来百货从开业之初，他就密切关注过，与我市其他商场不同，胖东来百货的内部管理具有人文性。以前，市民到商场购物，退货不退货由商家说了算，而胖东来百货推出的“不满意就退货”，服务周到，便民利民。新增的这项条款是一个创新，真正让市民体会到了做“上帝”的美妙享受。这一点是值得肯定的。", "block_bbox": [198, 1030, 976, 1161], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1030.0], [976.0, 1030.0], [976.0, 1161.0], [198.0, 1161.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "平原大学经济与管理学院院长，教授梁益海把胖东来百货比作“不是超市的超市”，不是导购员的导购员，他认为，一个商场除了环境好以外，还要让顾客购物随意，舒", "block_bbox": [204, 1169, 976, 1231], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[204.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1231.0], [204.0, 1231.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1002, 611, 1138, 725], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[1002.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.6706629395484924, "coordinate": [847, 134, 1082, 249], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[847.0, 134.0], [1082.0, 134.0], [1082.0, 249.0], [847.0, 249.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9419460296630859, "coordinate": [198, 228, 976, 395], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 228.0], [976.0, 228.0], [976.0, 395.0], [198.0, 395.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9384649395942688, "coordinate": [199, 403, 976, 499], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 403.0], [976.0, 403.0], [976.0, 499.0], [199.0, 499.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9243176579475403, "coordinate": [198, 508, 976, 568], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 508.0], [976.0, 508.0], [976.0, 568.0], [198.0, 568.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8504712581634521, "coordinate": [239, 613, 436, 639], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 613.0], [436.0, 613.0], [436.0, 639.0], [239.0, 639.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7888214588165283, "coordinate": [238, 648, 974, 675], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 648.0], [974.0, 648.0], [974.0, 675.0], [238.0, 675.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9541366100311279, "coordinate": [199, 683, 529, 987], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 683.0], [529.0, 683.0], [529.0, 987.0], [199.0, 987.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8088611960411072, "coordinate": [240, 996, 527, 1021], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 996.0], [527.0, 996.0], [527.0, 1021.0], [240.0, 1021.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9683390855789185, "coordinate": [553, 705, 964, 987], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[553.0, 705.0], [964.0, 705.0], [964.0, 987.0], [553.0, 987.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.8248065114021301, "coordinate": [842, 995, 950, 1015], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[842.0, 995.0], [949.0, 995.0], [949.0, 1014.0], [842.0, 1014.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9557339549064636, "coordinate": [198, 1030, 976, 1161], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1030.0], [976.0, 1030.0], [976.0, 1161.0], [198.0, 1161.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9110714197158813, "coordinate": [204, 1169, 976, 1231], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[204.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1169.0], [976.0, 1231.0], [204.0, 1231.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5777143239974976, "coordinate": [1002, 611, 1138, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1002.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 611.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "足，有些是令顾客十分气愤的。比如个别员工对顾客态度粗暴了，在工作中不是按照理念最大限度满足顾客的要求和利益等。一旦出现上述情况，我们都要毫不留情地马上处理。但另一方面，我们对员工是负责任的，我们力争为每一名员工提供最好的工资待遇，提供最完善的社会保障，提供最大的发展空间，真正让人尽其才，劳有所得，快乐生活，贡献社会。\n\n史延伟说，我们有信心让胖东来的员工从心底里感受到，胖东来的员工是生活在一个幸福、和谐的大家庭，我们也有信心服务好新乡人民，成为新乡人民生活中不可或缺的好朋友！\n\n古人云：“天行健，君子当自强不息。” 记者想把这句话送给在新乡刮起商业“旋风”的胖东来百货，也送给一切有志于繁荣新乡经济的弄潮儿……\n\n## 专家解析胖东来现象\n\n河南师范大学经济与管理学院党委书记、公共关系学副教授朱建认为，胖东来商贸集\n\n团选择到我市投资建商场，说明了我市经济发展较为繁荣的现状。有人放言，我市平原路上的商场已近饱和，其实不然，在他看来，我市的市场繁荣程度还不够，缺乏成规模的、品质优异的大型综合商场，市民的购买欲望还没有被完全激发出来。而胖东来百货的进驻，无疑成为我市市场繁荣的一个新的经济增长点。\n\n胖东来百货为什么人气如此旺\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_553_705_964_987.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"34%\" /></div>\n\n\n篮球比赛现场\n\n盛？朱建坦率地讲，胖东来百货从开业之初，他就密切关注过，与我市其他商场不同，胖东来百货的内部管理具有人文性。以前，市民到商场购物，退货不退货由商家说了算，而胖东来百货推出的“不满意就退货”，服务周到，便民利民。新增的这项条款是一个创新，真正让市民体会到了做“上帝”的美妙享受。这一点是值得肯定的。\n\n平原大学经济与管理学院院长，教授梁益海把胖东来百货比作“不是超市的超市”，不是导购员的导购员，他认为，一个商场除了环境好以外，还要让顾客购物随意，舒\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_847_134_1082_249.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_847_134_1082_249.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F6c0bcb6a43df7f0344751f935111436fdda59c4cfc83f3a515be1fba44614ae7", "imgs/img_in_image_box_553_705_964_987.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_553_705_964_987.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A46Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcc9c4682d830d0ac23d989f129c4104fd151b9114dda7903b5b4addcb0cd9f74", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_611_1138_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A46Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff197ec450d4241c22cd215ef74b1c078c144aeb06641006c7b7a6944ac2366bd"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A46Z%2F-1%2F%2F19955cdf61387f16be907dfc17ff8efd40e5bd6c455de3c136c5c00e27d569e9"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A47Z%2F-1%2F%2F488d44319dac62ed6be7457bb36cb485cf28f773c6d03e9c10dd319705dc405c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2707f1ea-f24e-4a54-9576-82e69fb165ea/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?au